/101746#issuecomment-2599844860","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101746","id":2599844860,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6a9nv8","user":{"login":"clayjohn","id":16521339,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NTIxMzM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16521339?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn","html_url":"https://github.com/clayjohn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-18T19:09:38Z","updated_at":"2025-01-18T19:09:38Z","body":"Cc @StaydMcMuffin must be a problem with the normal we write out for SDFGI","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2599844860/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2603593440","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/101746#issuecomment-2603593440","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101746","id":2603593440,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6bL67g","user":{"login":"StaydMcMuffin","id":38304659,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM4MzA0NjU5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/38304659?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/StaydMcMuffin","html_url":"https://github.com/StaydMcMuffin","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StaydMcMuffin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StaydMcMuffin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StaydMcMuffin/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StaydMcMuffin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StaydMcMuffin/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StaydMcMuffin/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StaydMcMuffin/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StaydMcMuffin/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StaydMcMuffin/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-21T03:38:58Z","updated_at":"2025-01-21T03:38:58Z","body":"> Cc [@StaydMcMuffin](https://github.com/StaydMcMuffin) must be a problem with the normal we write out for SDFGI\n\nI'm actually stumped by this one. Assuming the normals that get written out are from the `normal_output_buffer`/`normal_roughness_output_buffer` variables assigned in the `MODE_RENDER_MATERIAL`/`MODE_RENDER_NORMAL_ROUGHNESS` blocks at the end of the shader, there should be no real difference from my changes, as these seem to just pack the final shading normal.\nGranted I'm not very familiar with the SDFGI side of things, so someone more knowledgeable than I should probably take a look. Perhaps there's a discrepancy between what's being output and what the SDFGI shaders expect?","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2603593440/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2617352558","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/101746#issuecomment-2617352558","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101746","id":2617352558,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6cAaFu","user":{"login":"clayjohn","id":16521339,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NTIxMzM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16521339?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn","html_url":"https://github.com/clayjohn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-28T00:55:58Z","updated_at":"2025-01-28T00:55:58Z","body":"Solved! We were using the `geo_normal` for writing out the normals for SDFGI instead of using the normal_interp. So we were wrongly flipping the normal direction based on `gl_FrontFacing` when we shouldn't have","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2617352558/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":2,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2625580072","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/101746#issuecomment-2625580072","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101746","id":2625580072,"nod